                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is my data private?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Yes. All data is encrypted at rest using per-user encryption keys and in transit via TLS. We never share your information with third parties. <a href="security.html" class="text-av-gold hover:underline">Read the security details.</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is Arsenal Vault the same as Arsenal Tracker?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">No. Arsenal Vault is not the App Store app named Arsenal Tracker. Arsenal Vault is a separate product: a cloud app you use in a browser, including your phone, free forever for up to 5 firearms, plus an optional Windows desktop edition.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Does Free include PDF insurance reports?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">No. Free forever for up to 5 firearms includes serials, photos, and CSV export you can use for a claim. The insurance-ready PDF is on Pro and Ultimate.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What are Vault Members?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Vault Members are trusted people you invite to view or help manage your collection: a co-owner, spouse, or trusted family member. The owner's plan covers all members. Pro includes up to 5 members. Ultimate includes up to 10.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is Private Vault?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Private Vault is an optional cloud privacy mode. Your passphrase wraps the vault encryption key so locked vault data stays unreadable without your key. It includes passphrase unlock, idle lock, manual lock, and a recovery kit at setup. <a href="#private-vault" class="text-av-gold hover:underline">See Private Vault details.</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is Private Vault included with Pro or Ultimate?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Ultimate includes Private Vault. Basic and Pro can add it for ${{ pricing.privateVault.monthly }}/mo or ${{ pricing.privateVault.yearly }}/yr. The free plan does not include Private Vault.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Can Arsenal Vault recover my data if I forget my Private Vault passphrase?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">No. If you lose your passphrase and recovery phrase, the data cannot be recovered by Arsenal Vault. Save your recovery kit somewhere safe before enabling Private Vault. Resetting your account password also does not recover the Private Vault key.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the difference between Cloud and Desktop?</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Cloud is free forever for up to 5 firearms and works in a browser, including your phone. Paid Cloud plans add unlimited firearms, sharing, and PDF reports. Desktop is a Windows annual license that renews yearly, and data stays on your machine. Desktop is not the Cloud free plan.</p>
